# The oldest browsers the site supports: the last Chrome, Edge and Firefox releases for
# Windows 7 and 8.1, and the first Safari with the container queries and regex lookbehind
# the site relies on. These sit below Angular's own floor, so the build warns about them,
# and any newer colour or stylesheet feature needs a fallback that works in them
Chrome >= 109
Edge >= 109
Firefox >= 115
Safari >= 16.4
iOS >= 16.4
